e Chester County record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 39% of normal in November to December and 154% in May to June. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 37% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 17895 had its driest year in 2007 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
